                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "There. The fourth one."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "Wait. Hold still while I fit them into the housing. I've practiced this a hundred times, but my hands are shaking."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "",
                  "text": "The four cells lock together. Light pulses through the seams, faster and faster. The new Mag rises from Elio's palms, hesitates, then drifts toward her."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "Oh. Oh, hello."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "I'll take care of you. I promise. I'll do better this time."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "Thank you for keeping me alive out here. I want to walk back with this one. Just the two of us."
